### Who are the individuals historically credited with the conceptualization and establishment of the International Monetary Fund (IMF)?
Answer: The International Monetary Fund (IMF) was conceived at the **Bretton Woods conference in July 1944** and officially created in 1946. The search result does not specify individual names but attributes its establishment to this multilateral international financial conference.

